[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Unscrew the bolt.</p><p>2. Remove the courtesy light from the retainers.</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Front driver&#x27;s door light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024103\">G51</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Front passenger door light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024105\">G52</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005311.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<p>1. If necessary, remove the bulb from the retainers.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005312.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the courtesy light\nis not damaged and that the retainers are intact.</p><p>If the bulb was removed, refit in its socket.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection</p><p>Fit the courtesy light.</p><p>Tighten the bolt.</p><p>Check the operation of the courtesy light.</p>"]]